$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~32 min | Difficulty: Very Hard]] Armistice Station is being evacuated, and the movers need thirty minutes to load. The Cylons know it. Red flight and the Halyard hold the station through everything the Cylons throw at it, until the Theseus jumps in.", -1)
$end_multi_text

